<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial">Dear {!Lead.OwnerFirstName},</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">The lead {!Lead.Name} from {!Lead.Company} has been Qualified and assigned to you.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><span style="font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Click&nbsp;</span><a href="{!Lead.Link}"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">here</font><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></a><span style="font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">to visit this lead record in SFDC</span></div><div style=""><span style="font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></div><div style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><div style="">As a reminder, the following SLA’s are expected for any MQL lead:</div><div style="">If a Lead has been Qualified and Reassigned to you, you must either 'Claim' the Lead to move the Stage to SAL or disposition the Lead if you are not pursuing. This should be completed within 3 days of assignment.</div><div style=""><br></div><div style="">Leads move to a terminated state if there is no activity for 30 days and 90 days since the creation date.</div><div style=""><br></div><div style="">Thank you.</div></font></span></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>